OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry start with any
OL,6,Fisolated showers across northernmost
OL,7,Fareas easing. Early cloud breaks to
OL,8,Fgive some sunny spells through the
OL,9,Fmorning. Heavy showers and
OL,10,Fthunderstorms are then likely to
OL,11,Fdevelop during the afternoon, with a
OL,12,Frisk of hail.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FAny thunderstorms are likely
OL,15,Fto ease during the evening, however
OL,16,Fheavy showers are likely to continue
OL,17,Finto the early hours especially in the
OL,18,Fsouth. Perhaps dry for most by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
