OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA fine start, with sunny
OL,6,Fspells. Scattered showers then
OL,7,Fdeveloping, the odd one perhaps heavy
OL,8,Fand thundery, before easing during the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Cloud thickening from the
OL,10,Fwest later. Breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FMostly
OL,13,Fdry Tuesday, although a few showers
OL,14,Faround. Rather windy Wednesday, with
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain, occasionally heavy.
OL,16,FLikely drier Thursday, but still
OL,17,Fwindy. Daytime temperatures near
OL,18,Fnormal, but warm overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
